ily: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">하계방학 교외 집중근로 프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\"&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학생 희망근로지 신청기간을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학생 희망근로지 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청 기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움;\"><b style=\"\"><u>2025. 5. 20.(화) 9시 ~ 2025. 5. 29.(목) 18시까지</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ 마감일 신청자 증가로 인해 신청이 어려울 수 있으므로 미리 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청 대상&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2025-1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 국가근로장학금 학생신청기간(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차, 추가신청) 재학생&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※ 학기초과자는 신청 및 매칭되어도 선발 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;* 기본요건 : 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(C0수준)이상이며, 학자금 지원 9구간 이하인 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">첨부파일 매뉴얼 참고&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청한 희망근로지 순위대로 사전선정 실시 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><u>최소 3개 이상 근로지 선택 필수</u>, 3개 미만 선택 시 신청완료 되지않음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">집중근로 운영기간(근로기간) : 2025. 7. 1.(화) ~ 8. 31.(일) [기관별 상이]</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b>★ 유의 사항</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">①&nbsp;<b>희망근로지 선택 및 내용 작성 후</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>, 신청완료 버튼을 반드시 눌러야 함</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">작성 후, 신청완료 버튼을 클릭하지 않아 참여를 못하는 사례가 많이 발생하고 있습니다. 최종 지원을 위해 신청완료 버튼을 반드시 눌러주세요.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(80, 80, 80); letter-spacing: 0px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">②&nbsp;</span><strong sizetype=\"px\" defaultsize=\"13\" currentsize=\"13\" style=\"color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">근로지 업무내용, 근로기간, 시간, 위치 등을 반드시 확인 후 신청